1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,575
M: I picked up a cell phone here the other day, but there is something the matter with the screen.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,040
It keeps blinking out all the time.

3
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:09,140
I would like an exchange on it, please.

4
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,620
W: Of course, sir.

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:15,320
Why don't you give that to me, and I can get you a new one from the back room right away?

6
00:00:15,715 --> 00:00:19,220
M: Actually, I was wondering if I could take another model instead?

7
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:25,180
I was told that the new X-100 model has far more functions than the one I got.

8
00:00:25,755 --> 00:00:26,960
Do you have it in stock today?

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,460
W: Yes, we do, and I think you have made a wise choice.

10
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:35,300
This particular model was only released a week ago, and they're selling like hot cakes.

11
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:42,340
Of course it is a bit more expensive, and you will have to pay for the difference, but I think it will be well worth your money.
